    "description": "Reads all component Props interfaces and flags inconsistencies across the library: mixed boolean naming (disabled vs isDisabled), mismatched size enums, missing standard props (className, disabled), and structural mismatches within component families. Produces a grouped findings report prioritised by breaking impact.",
